line	<str>Talk to Veliaf Hurtz next to Drezel at Paterdomus. (Fairy ring CKS, Salve Graveyard Teleport tablet, Slayer ring)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Ivan Strom south of Fenkenstrain's Castle. (Fenkenstrain's Castle Teleport tablet)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Ivan Strom east of Paterdomus (north of fairy ring CKS ) to begin the trek.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head south-east of Burgh de Rott to the boat house and talk to Ivan Strom.</str>
line	
line	<str>Board the boat and head to the Icyene graveyard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Veliaf Hurtz.</str>
line	
line	<str>After the cutscene, talk to Vanescula Drakan</str>
line	
line	<str>Unlock the mausoleum door north of you.</str>
line	
line	<str>Solve the Mausoleum Door's puzzle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to everyone in this order:</str>
line	
line	<str>Finish the conversation with Vanescula Drakan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use Drakan's medallion to teleport to Ver Sinhaza and ask the Vyrewatch next to the bank to send you to the mines.</str>
line	
line	<str>Mine 15 Daeyalt ore and place them in the cart. (If you forgot a pickaxe, talk to any miner for a bronze one.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Vampyre Juvinate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head south-east to the house with the slashed tapestry and the statue.</str>
line	
line	<str>Walk through the tapestry.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go down the staircase.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Safalaan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill the Mutated Bloodveld.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Safalaan again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the bookshelf on the western wall inside the room filled with mutated bloodvelds.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Safalaan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head back to Burgh de Rott. (Morytania legs 3 , Mort'ton teleport or Shades of Mort'ton minigame teleport and run south-east to the boat or Drakan's Medallion and run south-west to the boat.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the boat back to the Icyene Graveyard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Veliaf at the eastern part of the graveyard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your Drakan's medallion to teleport to Ver Sinhaza.</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit to the west towards Meiyerditch.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go down the trapdoor in the northern room of Old Man Ral's house. (Old Man Ral's house is to the west)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Polmafi Ferdygris. (Make sure to upgrade the outfit to Noble)</str>
line	
line	<str>Make your way back to Icyene Graveyard by either:</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Vanescula Drakan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take the boat to Slepe.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Veliaf at the graveyard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill Damien Leucurte.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Veliaf.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your Drakan's Medallion to teleport to Ver Sinhaza and prepare for the next step.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back to the Icyene Graveyard (Use Morytania legs 3 or Drakan's Medallion and take the boat to the north or Mort'ton teleport and take the boat south-east of Burgh de Rott).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Vanescula Drakan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip the Vyre noble clothing.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your Drakan's medallion to teleport to Ver Sinhaza.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Vyrewatch right next to the bank and ask to be sent to the mines.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to a Vampyre Juvinate to exit the mine. You do not have to mine daeyalt ore this time.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go through the crack north of the mining hole.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the Arboretum. (The tree icon east of the bank in Darkmeyer.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Finish the dialogue with the guard Desmodus Lasiurus.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the house with a water symbol north-east of the furnace, along the east wall near the crack.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Mordan Nikazsi.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the prison in the northern part of Darkmeyer, north of the Arboretum.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Maria Gadderanks.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the Arboretum and enter it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the toppled shelves for an old note.</str>
line	
line	<str>Read it, and take note of how many gallons the tree requires to be cut.</str>
line	
line	<str>Look up the required gallons in the solution table and set the north and south valve to the given values.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Cut eight blisterwood logs.</col>
