line	<str>Cut eight blisterwood logs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head back to the Icyene Graveyard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Veliaf/Vanescula.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use your Drakan's medallion to teleport to Ver Sinhaza.</str>
line	
